sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Curator or user
    participant B as Backend
    participant M as Exit market
    U->>M: Read exit capacity, no permission needed
    U->>B: Set a utilization threshold
    B->>M: Snapshot capacity every minute
    Note over U,B: Utilization crosses the threshold
    B->>U: In-app alert and signed webhook
